addLab('watermark','訊號浮水印與內容真偽','實際演算法','合成訊號加入固定種子±1標記，再以相關性檢測；不等於真實影音來源認證。',[LN('strength','標記強度',.2,0,1,.05),LN('noise','後處理噪聲',.2,0,1,.05),LN('keep','保留取樣數',32,4,64)],v=>{const r=calcValue("r",(lrandom(31))),base=calcValue("base",(Array.from({length:64},(_,i)=>calcMath("sin",[calcBinary("*",(i),(.5),"i*.5")],"Math.sin(i*.5)")))),mark=calcValue("mark",(base.map(()=>calcBinary(">",(r()),(.5),"r()>.5")?1:calcUnary("-",(1),"-1")))),noise=calcValue("noise",(lrandom(42))),out=calcValue("out",(base.map((x,i)=>calcBinary("+",(calcBinary("+",(x),(calcBinary("*",(v.strength),(mark[i]),"v.strength*mark[i]")),"x+v.strength*mark[i]")),(calcBinary("*",(v.noise),(calcBinary("-",(noise()),(.5),"noise()-.5")),"v.noise*(noise()-.5)")),"x+v.strength*mark[i]+v.noise*(noise()-.5)")))),score=calcValue("score",(lmean(out.slice(0,v.keep).map((x,i)=>calcBinary("*",(calcBinary("-",(x),(base[i]),"x-base[i]")),(mark[i]),"(x-base[i])*mark[i]")))));return {metrics:[['已知原訊號下的標記相關分數',score]],series:[{name:'原訊號',values:base},{name:'帶標記與噪聲',values:out}],lines:['此檢測假設有原訊號與標記。未檢出不能證明非AI；深度偽造也不能只憑觀感判真。']}} ,'深度偽造|浮水印');
